# Rule: Brandmark / sigil choreography

The mark is **`position: fixed`** and must track **sigil → HUD → orbit** without hero flashes or practice snaps.

**Read first:** `sentinel/decisions/010-brandmark-choreography.md`, `.claude/skills/brandmark-choreography/SKILL.md`, `sentinel/decisions/008-landing-v7-background-layers.md`.

**Process:** `sentinel/MAINTENANCE.md` — live rects, `onLeave` settlement; avoid CSS sticky hacks without an ADR.
